      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INFRA ROCK (6) is a consistent dog overall, in the frame at 27 of 60 starts including 13 wins but missed the frame latest when fifth (34.72) over 600m at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Looks the testing material here. MIGHTY MISS (1) was safely held in tougher company last start after settling well back at Sandown, but prior to that won by at Bendigo (28.17) beating Liddell in a Grade 5 on July 31. Expected to give a good account. GREYSYND SAMMY (3) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Sandown over 715m behind Amron Toy (43.05) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Has ability and is one of the better chances. LET'S CAUSE KAOS (2) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot from this box most recently.",
